@node Generated Command Reference
@section Generated Command Reference
@cindex command reference, generated
@cindex dispatch, generated

Every concrete @code{gascity-command} class, its @command{gc}
subcommand and its summary.  The table is generated from the
classes' `:documentation' option, so a renamed subcommand or a
changed docstring is drift.

