@tab @code{gc session rename} --- Rename a session (`gc session rename <target> <title>').
@item @code{gascity-command-session-reset}
@tab @code{gc session reset} --- Restart a session fresh while preserving its bead.
@item @code{gascity-command-session-suspend}
@tab @code{gc session suspend} --- Suspend a session (stop its runtime; the bead persists).
@item @code{gascity-command-session-unpin}
@tab @code{gc session unpin} --- Remove a session's durable awake pin (`gc session unpin <target>').
