@tab @code{gc sling} --- Route a bead (or task text/formula) to a session or agent.
@item @code{gascity-command-start}
@tab @code{gc start} --- Start the city under the machine-wide supervisor.
@item @code{gascity-command-status}
@tab @code{gc status} --- Show the Gas City town status.
@item @code{gascity-command-stop}
@tab @code{gc stop} --- Stop all agent sessions in the city (graceful shutdown).
